INSERT INTO `holley_products` VALUES ('Ignition','BDDP','ACCEL','Spark Plug','042511181793','Hp Copper Spark Plug','SPARK PLUG 8PK OF 0576','ACCEL HP Spark Plugs are made with a Copper core which is a better conductor than Platinum and Iridium. They deliver a stronger spark especially in high performance applications where high combustion pressures are present. Copper is much better at dissipating heat than other materials which lessens the chance of a misfire. ACCEL HP Spark Plugs are gapable allowing you to open the gap exposing a larger flame kernel or close it if needed for high boost applications. All ACCEL HP Spark Plugs have machine rolled threads allowing for a more precise thread engagement and torque retention.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CQwKRKZ5tsA+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HYJZ8Crek8Q+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rvQW4oFqJt8','ACCEL HP Copper Spark Plug','Secondary Ignition','8179',NULL,'1.10','3.50','7.90','3.50','1.10','7.90','0.75',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),('Ignition','BDDP','ACCEL','Buick, Cadillac, Chevrolet, Chrysler... Spark Plug','042511181977','Hp Copper Spark Plug','HEADERPLUG 8DISPLAY 0437S','ACCEL\'s patented race proven spark plugs in a Shorty configuration. The overall length has been reduced 3/16 in to 3/8 in (depending on the specific spark plug) to gain critical air gap between the spark plug boot and the exhaust manifold or header tube. This helps eliminate burning the spark plug boot or dimpling the header tube. The shorter spark plug length also can make it easier to install an remove the spark plugs in certain applications where there is not a lot of room to fit a socket or move a wrench around. ACCEL Shorty Spark Plugs are made with a Copper core which is a better conductor than Platinum and Iridium. They deliver a stronger spark especially in high performance applications where high combustion pressures are present. Copper is much better at dissipating heat than other materials which lessens the chance of a misfire. ACCEL Shorty Spark Plugs are gapable allowing you to open the gap exposing a larger flame kernel or close it if needed for high boost applications. All ACCEL Shorty Spark Plugs have machine rolled threads allowing for a more precise thread engagement and torque retention.','https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/cadfce011d73313328600ce21aeed58c.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/56fbf8950cbeef6b6606ed35d2b6b22b.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/85366f170de011c5d6e1b44e2df8679a.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/08715bf10ddf590303b68f2314cee8c2.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/64fc3f55f979e6f8e834c4be71e45429.jpg+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CQwKRKZ5tsA+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HYJZ8Crek8Q+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rvQW4oFqJt8','ACCEL HP Copper Spark Plug - Shorty','Secondary Ignition','8197','Chrysler~Dodge~Plymouth~Buick~Cadillac~Chevrolet~GMC~Oldsmobile~Pontiac','1.20','3.50','6.00','3.50','1.20','6.00','1.10','300~Cordoba~Imperial~New Yorker~Newport~Town & Country~Windsor~Saratoga~330~880~M300~M350~Polara~B100 Van~B200~B300~D100~D150~D200~D300~W100~W150~W200~W300~B200 Van~CB300~Challenger~Charger~Coronet~D100 Pickup~D200 Pickup~D300 Pickup~Dart~Magnum~Monaco~Ramcharger~Royal Monaco~W100 Pickup~W200 Pickup~W300 Pickup~440~Suburban~Barracuda~Belvedere~Cuda~Fleet Special~Fury I~Fury II~Fury III~GTX~Plaza~Satellite~Savoy~Superbird~VIP~PB200~PB300~Fury~Gran Fury~Road Runner~Trailduster~Custom~Belvedere II~Invicta~Wildcat~Gran Sport~Electra~LeSabre~Riviera~Skylark~Special~Sportwagon~Series 60 Fleetwood~Series 70 Fleetwood Eldorado~Calais~DeVille~Eldorado~Fleetwood~Series 75 Fleetwood~Series 62~Biscayne~Brookwood~C10 Pickup~C20 Pickup~C30 Pickup~Chevy II~Del Ray~G10 Van~K10 Pickup~K20 Pickup~K30 Pickup~Kingswood~One-Fifty Series~Townsman~Two-Ten Series~Chevelle~G20 Van~Bel Air~Blazer~C10 Suburban~C20 Suburban~Camaro~Caprice~Corvette~El