om time to time. If performance is at the top of your list then step up to ACCEL\'s Late Model Tune-Up Kits with HP Copper Core spark plugs and COP High Performance Boots for 2 & 3 valve modular Ford engines or HP Copper Core spark plugs and a set of LS Ceramic booted plug wires for you GM folks!',NULL,'Accel Ford 1998-2008 2-Valve Tune Up Kit',NULL,'811732',NULL,'5.60','6.30','8.50','6.30','5.60','8.50','3.95',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),(NULL,'BDDP','ACCEL',NULL,'090127739020','Ford 2004early 2008','OBS FORD EARLY 3 VALVE TUNE UP KIT','If you own a vehicle 15 years old or newer odds are it doesn\'t have a distributor or, in some cases, ignition wires. In the old days the parts required for a tune-up consisted of points, condenser, distributor cap, rotor, spark plugs and a set of spark plug wires. Although most of today\'s vehicles can go many more miles between tune-ups than before they still need to have their ignition systems serviced from time to time. If performance is at the top of your list then step up to ACCEL\'s Late Model Tune-Up Kits with HP Copper Core spark plugs and COP High Performance Boots for 2 & 3 valve modular Ford engines or HP Copper Core spark plugs and a set of LS Ceramic booted plug wires for you GM folks!',NULL,'Accel Ford 2004-Early 2008 3-Valve Tune Up Kit',NULL,'811733',NULL,'6.50','6.60','8.20','6.60','6.50','8.20','2.30',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),(NULL,'BDDP','ACCEL',NULL,'090127739037','Gm Gen 4 Ls Tuneup','OBS GM GEN 4 LS TUNE UP KIT','ACCEL now offers the cure for burnt spark plug wire boots with Extreme 9000 Ceramic Wire kits. The 8mm Ferro-Spiral core wire now has ceramic boots on the spark plug end of the wires. The ceramic boots will withstand up to 2,000 degrees F. If you are running headers with close tolerances, have an engine bay with little room or an RV with boots that melt because of heat, these wire kits are the answer for burnt and melting boots. The wire uses a 500 Ohms/ft Ferro-Spiral core developed for performance use. It provides excellent energy delivery to the spark plugs, while providing the highest level of RFI/EMI suppression. The Extreme 9000 Ceramic Wires also feature stainless steel spark plug terminals for maximum spark energy to the plugs.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zKcsT9_vhBw','Accel GM Gen 4 LS Tune-Up Kit',NULL,'819070',NULL,'6.30','8.90','9.90','8.90','6.30','9.90','3.90',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),('Ignition','BDDP','ACCEL','Distributor Cap and Rotor Kit','090127741337','Distributor Cap','CAPROTOR GM OPTISPARK I','ACCEL performance distributor cap and rotor kits offer superior protection from damaging misfires. High-output racing ignition systems place severe demands on these components, and that\'s why ACCEL makes sure these kits provide optimal shielding against damage. The ACCEL performance distributor cap and rotor kit designed for your application will defend your parts against high voltage, surges of spark current, and high temperatures, all of which can liquify run-of-the-mill cap and rotor\'s molded parts!  More product features include:\n* High-quality compound caps ensure stability\n* Corrosion-resistant inserts help provide high-sparking energy flow','https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/bffde20658bb23321ec37b7dbc722175.jpg+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yNN4-t9WpOo','Distributor Cap & Rotor Kit, GM Opti-Spark','Distributor and Magneto','8136A',NULL,'5.00','9.30','10.10','9.30','5.00','10.10','1.40',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:08'),('Ignition','BDDP','ACCEL','Ford (3.5, 3.7) Direct Ignition Coil','090127743461','Ignition','COILFORD ECOBOOST 35L V6 SINGLE YELLO','ACCEL has been offering high quality high output COP coils for Ford\'s 2-valve, 3-valve and 5.0L Coyote applications for years, now EcoBoost owners can enjoy the benefits of ACCEL Supercoils as well!  ACCEL SuperCoils feature ad