 Motors Rebel 1959 1960\nAmerican Motors Rebel 1961 1961\nInternational M Series Van 1961 1964',NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),('Ignition','BDDP','ACCEL','Ignition Contact Set and Condenser Kit','743047006917','High Performance','CONTCOND HP 32 OZ','ACCEL Replacement High Performance Point & Condenser Kit with 32oz Spring Tension (Up to 6,500 RPM). Fits Ford V8 1957-1974.\nRegain horsepower and economy for your street machine with new contact and condenser kit. Large tungsten contacts provide crisp coil firing and perform solidly up to 6,500 RPM. Condenser\'s special winding protects from pitting of point contacts. Heavy duty 32 ounce points. ACCEL ignition contact points are equipped with extra-thick contact arms to prevent flexing on the top end. The large, radiused tungsten contacts provide crisp circuit breaking for peak coil output. They also feature high-strength phenolic rubbing blocks for superior durability when used with heavier spring tensions. ACCEL Performance condensers contain special Mylar/foil windings to protect your points from pitting. With moisture-proof Buna-N seals on the condenser setup, these kits are sure to offer long life and great reliability.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yNN4-t9WpOo','High Performance Point & Condenser Kit, 32oz, Ford V8','Secondary Ignition','8203ACC',NULL,'1.30','4.00','7.15','4.00','1.30','7.15','0.15',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),('Ignition','BDDP','ACCEL','American Motors, Buick, Cadillac, Checker... Distributor Cap and Rotor Kit','743047006931','Distributor Cap','CAPROTOR','ACCEL cap and rotor kits offer superior protection from \"arc-thru\" and crossfire. Features 60k V-rated alkyd compound, stress-relieved at molding to ensure stability. Brass inserts and steel rotor springs provide for high spark energy flow.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yNN4-t9WpOo','ACCEL Distributor Cap & Rotor Kit - Female Socket Style - Tan','Distributor and Magneto','8120ACC