ocess to assure a gas tight seal.  Electric heat seal seals tighter for a stable heat range.  Machine rolled threads for trouble-free installation and removal.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HYJZ8Crek8Q+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rvQW4oFqJt8','Spark Plugs - Copper Core - Evolution - .040\" gap - 24 Pack',NULL,'SP2410A',NULL,'3.70','4.90','9.90','4.90','3.70','9.90','3.55',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),(NULL,'BDDP','ACCEL',NULL,'743047024188','Spark Plugs Platinum','OBS SHOP PACK2418P SPARK PLUGS','ACCEL Platinum spark plugs are manufactured from the best materials available and include the finest quality assurance of any spark plug available to ensure long, trouble-free operation. The premium quality platinum tip is more durable than standard plug material so the spark plug will maintain the proper gap much longer than ordinary plugs. The proper spark plug gap requires less voltage to fire so you will have fewer misfires for long periods of use. The pure copper center electrode reduces fouling. Easier starting, improved fuel economy, smooth idling and quicker acceleration are just a few benefits of ACCEL Platinum spark plugs.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HYJZ8Crek8Q+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rvQW4oFqJt8','Spark Plugs - Platinum - Twin Cam - .040\" Gap - 24 Pack',NULL,'SP2418P',NULL,'3.60','5.00','9.60','5.00','3.60','9.60','2.55',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),('Ignition','BDDP','ACCEL','Checker, Chevrolet, GMC Spark Plug Wire Set','743047035429','Spark Plug Wire Set','8mm SUPER STOCK GRAPHITE CUST','These ACCEL Super Stock wire sets are a true performance upgrade replacement for OE types. Efficient delivery of spark energy for a good price. Silicone boots with zinc-plated steel terminals.','https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/436d7bc48e1ad20d53eed58e07d545ad.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/84f1aae58e7dfeeb720a20af1c1059ce.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us