ing characteristics of factory installed and aftermarket CDI systems, getting maximum performance with fast rise times.',NULL,'Universal Super Coils Black',NULL,'140405K',NULL,'2.30','6.40','11.70','6.40','2.30','11.70','2.00',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:08'),(NULL,'BDDP','ACCEL',NULL,'743047112700','Spark Plug Wire Set','OBS 8MM SUPERSTOCK SPRL HOLDEN BLK','With only 500 Ohms/foot of resistance, more ignition energy can reach the spark plug, producing a hotter, longer-lasting spark flame kernel. The result is higher performance through improved efficiency, quicker throttle responses and reduced emissions. This 8mm wire\'s double silicone construction is rated to 550 degrees Fahrenheit. The high gloss wire jacket resists moisture, chemicals and heat extremes for longer life and great looks. The fiberglass braid adds greater pull strength and terminal retention, while the stainless steel spark plug terminals provide excellent long life, electrical conductivity and corrosion resistance.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zKcsT9_vhBw','Spark Plug Wire Set - Super Stock Spiral 8mm - Holden V8 - Black',NULL,'5148K',NULL,'3.50','4.40','7.20','4.40','3.50','7.20','2.05',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),('Ignition','BDDP','ACCEL','Ignition Coil','743047112762','Super Coil Twin Cam','COILTC CARB MODELS 3165599','These ACCEL Motorcycle Super Coils are designed to produce the maximum amount of spark energy, fast coil rise times and a voltage output that is 45% higher than the OEM coil. The ACCEL Super Coil is our highest output motorcycle coil. The Electronic Super Coil is easily installed in the OEM location using stock (later model year) coil covers on electronic ignitions. This coil carries a Lifetime Replacement Warranty and is made in the U.S.A. The ACCEL Super Coil is one of the best performance values that you can bolt on your motorcycle to achieve smoother idling, crisper throttle response and quick ACCELeration.','https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/93328e37cf18ef17bc9bdc4e92aa290e.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/3b7b7b299921e87f6636644d934a6e24.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/760d4a48fd11436aaf53d705fd725251.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/620194f385e23741a08a56a9030da32a.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/7ddb9ab61b04a051efe36b1a4af60039.jpg+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=20LF6FMLA_o','Super Coil - Twin Cam - Black','Ignition Coil','140409',NULL,'3.40','3.60','4.40','3.60','3.40','4.40','1.30',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),('Ignition','BDDP','ACCEL','Ignition Coil','743047112779','Twin Cam Super Coil','COILTC EFI MODELS 3174301','These ACCEL Motorcycle Super Coils are designed to produce the maximum amount of spark energy, fast coil rise times and a voltage output that is 45% higher than the OEM coil. The ACCEL Super Coil is our highest output motorcycle coil. The Electronic Super Coil is easily installed in the OEM location using stock (later model year) coil covers on electronic ignitions. This coil carries a Lifetime Replacement Warranty and is made in the U.S.A. The ACCEL Super Coil is one of the best performance values that you can bolt on your motorcycle to achieve smoother idling, crisper throttle response and quick ACCELeration.','https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/d93e9439a8b255a877ce4c52d881879a.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/30d5d57ed2f475994bab7a1c677b5535.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/832a09a6f5909617394345a3161c4460.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/bf63059fcf075adb0854e3d92214f564.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/3dfd863737ed4631354d3aaf4d264ac3.jpg+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=20LF6FMLA_o','Twin Cam Super Coil - Fuel Injection','Ignition Coil','140410',NULL,'3.50','3.70','4.40','3.70','3.50','4.40','1.10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),('Ignition','BDDP','ACCEL','Spark Plug','743047113028','Hp Copper Spark Plug','SPARK PLUGACCEL 4PK','ACCEL\'s patented race proven spark plugs in a Shorty configuration. The overall length has been reduced 3/16 in to 3/8 in (depending on the specific spark plug) to gain critical air gap between the spark plug boot and the exhaust manifold or header tube. This helps eliminate burning the spark plug boot or dimpling the header tube. The shorter spark plug length also can make it easier to install an remove the spark plugs in certain applications where there is not a lot of room to fit a socket or move a wrench around. ACCEL Shorty Spark Plugs are made with a Copper core which is a better conductor than Platinum and Iridium. They deliver a stronger spark especially in high performance applications where high combustion pressures are present. Copper is much better at dissipating heat than other materials which lessens the chance of a misfire. ACCEL Shorty Spark Plugs are gapable allowing you to open the gap exposing a larger flame kernel or close it if needed for high boost applications. All ACCEL Shorty Spark Plugs have machine rolled threads allowing for a more precise thread engagement and torque retention.','https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/f563dac1083a989efecb3a77b64b5944.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/93fa2104a91c82f731eddde9aa2e75a5.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/e4ebb66354699946baf8b33e63782f90.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/a2cd904229d69ffd1847124d941cfd8b.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/ff51037903cb2d65df1ed0a2cefa8b58.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/ba78ed7ffc6f015abc5d95d6379f6f23.jpg+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CQwKRKZ5tsA+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HYJZ8Crek8Q+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rvQW4oFqJt8','ACCEL HP Copper Spark Plug - Shorty','Secondary Ignition','0276S-4',NULL,'0.90','3.40','3.