your machine.','https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/e10706a7789c019a4c2924b5c684b235.jpg','SINGLE FIRE SUPER SYSTEM','Primary Ignition','35410',NULL,'6.30','7.90','10.20','7.90','6.30','10.20','2.75',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),('Ignition','BDDP','ACCEL','Ignition Control Module','743047414972','Singledual Fire','SINGLEDUAL FIRE IGN MODULE','These ACCEL Motorcycle ignition modules work with both single or dual fire coils eliminating the need to buy a new ignition when you change coils. They have 14 preset ignition curves to cover a stock engine through exhaust and intake changes to a full blown big inch high compression motor. Other features include an easily selectable rev limiter and L.E.D. timing light for quick static timing. The harness has V.O.E.S. input, tachometer output, and is externally grounded for better reliability. The housing is machined out of aluminum for better heat dissipation. Many hours of dyno testing went into creating this ignition so that it is simple to use and delivers the premium performance you expect from ACCEL.','https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/b766170ebe5e3109a360599e879d0a38.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/d6a96c51aed40dec648725bfa0563188.pdf','SINGLE/DUAL FIRE IGNITION MODULE','Control Modules','35496',NULL,'1.95','6.60','8.60','6.60','1.95','8.60','0.75',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),(NULL,'BDDP','ACCEL',NULL,'743047415023','Thundersport 5mm','OBS KITWIRE 5MMBLACK','ACCEL Motorsport Thundersport spark plug wires are half the diameter of stock wires and extremely flexible. Easy to run through cylinder heads, rocker covers, and frame tubes for a totally hidden look. 150 ohms per foot spiral wound core for better performance. High gloss 5mm silicone jacket rated at 550 degrees.',NULL,'THUNDERSPORT 5MM IGNITION WIRE',NULL,'173087-K',NULL,'1.85','6.65','8.05','6.65','1.85','8.05','0.51',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),('Electrical, Charging and Starting','BDDP','ACCEL','Starter Drive','743047415061','Starter Gear Big','GEARSTRTRBIG TWIN 90PRSNT','ACCEL Motorcycle starter drives provide superior strength and durability for reliable starting of mild to wild Harleys. Five roller clutches are used to reduce internal stresses. Specially hardened receivers provide smooth reliable starter engagement. Corrosion-resistant stainless steel springs eliminate binding. Precision-ground gears last longer and prevent ring gear damage.','https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/5e6eb20a48c326eac0115f7f5418bc85.jpg','Starter Gear - Big Twin','Starter and Related Components','151306',NULL,'2.60','3.30','3.80','3.30','2.60','3.80','0.95',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),('Electrical, Charging and Starting','BDDP','ACCEL','Charging System Voltage Regulator','743047415115','Electronic Voltage','REGLTRVLTGE 9403 SPSTR BLCK','ACCEL Motorcycle electronic voltage regulators do not require any re-wiring or special mounting. Heavy Duty solid-state circuitry and years of technology produce a regulator that has quality second to none and reliability that you can depend on year after year. They are made in the U.S.A. and are covered by a limited replacement warranty.','https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/d7400361ab7c50ff305d1428ef50b89a.jpg','ELECTRONIC VOLTAGE REGULATOR','Alternator / Generator and Related Components','201130B',NULL,'3.00','3.30','3.70','3.30','3.00','3.70','1.10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:08'),(NULL,'BDDP','ACCEL',NULL,'743047415122','Electronic Voltage','OBS REGLTRVLTG 9403 SPSTR CHRM','ACCEL Motorcycle electronic voltage regulators do not require any re-wiring or special mounting. Heavy Duty solid-state circuitry and years of technology produce a regulator that has quality second to none and reliability that you can depend on year after year. They are made in the U.S.A. an