ce spark plugs have a patented U-shaped ground electrode that produces a double wide, hotter spark to ignite standard or even the highest compression engines. The sintered alumina heavy-duty five rib insulator eliminates flashover and overheating that occurs with high performance and long range applications. ACCEL U-Groove spark plugs use the purest copper/nickel alloy electrode to produce a broad heat range that is highly foul resistant and dissipates heat better than any other material. Years of racing and street performance research has proven that ACCEL U-Groove spark plugs deliver the hottest spark and the highest performance of any spark plug available.','https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/f537f65814ee6fedf7e093c7e21f5468.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/cd39bcb279092925c03cd53efa50dfe1.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/e5622730cd8642138b5863e941e7d793.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/70920a094123c2f3d4898436de7bd371.jpg+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CQwKRKZ5tsA+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HYJZ8Crek8Q+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rvQW4oFqJt8','Spark Plugs - Copper Core - Evolution - .040\" gap - 2 Pack','Secondary Ignition','2410A',NULL,'0.90','1.90','4.20','1.90','0.90','4.20','0.30',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),('Ignition','BDDP','ACCEL','Spark Plug','743047940051','Spark Plugs Platinum','SPARK PLUG 2 PAK','ACCEL Platinum spark plugs are manufactured from the best materials available and include the finest quality assurance of any spark plug available to ensure long, trouble-free operation. The premium quality platinum tip is more durable than standard plug material so the spark plug will maintain the proper gap much longer than ordinary plugs. The proper spark plug gap requires less voltage to fire so you will have fewer misfires for long periods of use. The pure copper center electrode reduces fouling. Easier starting, improved fuel economy, smooth idling and quicker acceleration are just a few benefits of ACCEL Platinum spark plugs.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CQwKRKZ5tsA+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HYJZ8Crek8Q+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rvQW4oFqJt8+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/75fcae6d6d7edc168cc20f0f8d2dd4bd.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/915bc976519a9b52d018e8925516c036.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/d86196d773c2fc5008edfb5a54b76ae6.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/96ca1cfd3dc1d6c2d6ba5922bdd51dba.jpg','Spark Plugs - Platinum - Evolution - .040\" Gap - 2 Pack','Secondary Ignition','Y2410P',NULL,'0.90','2.00','3.30','2.00','0.90','3.30','1.90',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-05-07 08:04:39','2026-05-07 08:21:09'),('Ignition','BDDP','ACCEL','Spark Plug','743047940099','Spark Plugs Platinum','SPARK PLUG 2 PAK','ACCEL Platinum spark plugs are manufactured from the best materials available and include the finest quality assurance of any spark plug available to ensure long, trouble-free operation. The premium quality platinum tip is more durable than standard plug material so the spark plug will maintain the proper gap much longer than ordinary plugs. The proper spark plug gap requires less voltage to fire so you will have fewer misfires for long periods of use. The pure copper center electrode reduces fouling. Easier starting, improved fuel economy, smooth idling and quicker acceleration are just a few benefits of ACCEL Platinum spark plugs.','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CQwKRKZ5tsA+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HYJZ8Crek8Q+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rvQW4oFqJt8+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/d3bf6ff02829b13b50662a8ebcdd4444.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/30c4152903a03082e1f03bf7059101ac.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/781959ae9bb7af248c6fcae6d54b7ad2.jpg+https://prod-da.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BLVW/48b8f4742e7ad6cb743b95036a16babf.jpg','Spark Plug